# Frontend Verification

- After a visible change under `resources/` (layout, text, styling, error pages), check it with the `obscura` MCP server. Skip changes with no visible effect.
- Open the site over `http://`, not `https://`: local Herd sites are not secured and `https` fails with `UnknownIssuer`.
- If `obscura` is unavailable, say so instead of skipping verification silently.
